IMPORT `pvi-health-assessment`

-- THE HOSTILE READING: evidence for the findings in NOTES.md section 4. Each assertion states
-- what the Rules, as encoded, answer on a minimal scenario; the answer is the surprising part.
-- These assertions are EXPECTED TO PASS: they demonstrate the defect, they do not hide it.
-- A finding that the encoding cannot demonstrate is marked "reading only" in NOTES.md and has no
-- entry here.

§ `Findings`

