§§ `X3 — raising the benefits at renewal restarts every waiting period`

-- Insured since 2024 without a break; in 2026 riders are added. The definition of continuous
-- renewal requires benefits "thấp hơn hoặc bằng" (lower than or equal to) the previous ones, so
-- the 2026 certificate is not a continuous renewal at all, and the waiting periods of the MAIN
-- benefit A.2, which did not change, start again on 1 January 2026.
