§§ `X5 — an overnight stay of less than 24 hours falls between the benefits`

-- Admitted at 18:00, discharged at 10:00. It is inpatient treatment (overnight in a hospital bed)
-- but not a hospitalisation (24 continuous hours), so A.2 does not take it; not being a
-- hospitalisation it is outpatient treatment by definition, which without supplementary benefit 1
-- item 31 excludes.
