§§ `X11 — item 2 refuses the insured person injured by a beneficiary`

-- The insured person is beaten by her husband, who is a named beneficiary; she claims her
-- hospital costs. The proviso saves only "những người thụ hưởng hợp pháp khác" (the other lawful
-- beneficiaries), and the Rules distinguish the insured person from a beneficiary.
