§§ `X15 — emergency dental care after an accident waits 30 days`

-- B.2 covers emergency care only within 24 hours of an accident, and B.2.2 makes the whole benefit
-- wait 30 days with no exception for accidents (A.2 and B.1 have one). An accident in the first 30
-- days of the certificate can never be followed by covered emergency dental care.
