§§ `X17 — termination at will cuts off treatment already under way`

-- PVI may end the certificate on 30 days' written notice for any reason (5.2), and on termination
-- its liability ends "ngay lập tức", including costs after termination of an event that arose
-- while the certificate was in force (10). An insured person admitted on 29 June 2026 for four
-- nights, under a certificate PVI terminated with effect from 1 July 2026, is paid for 29 and 30
-- June only: 6,000,000 of 12,000,000.
