#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a plain claim under` `the renewed certificate terminated on 1 July 2026` `by` `the adult woman` `for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, arising and treated` (YMD 2026 6 29) `at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `:` `a four-night stay` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 6_000_000

§§ `X22 — any illness arising from an announced epidemic`

-- Item 7 excludes death, illness or injury arising "trực tiếp hoặc gián tiếp" (directly or
-- indirectly) from an epidemic that a central authority has announced, for every benefit.
